    "id": "BasicAnalysis.lem.ivtAverage",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Intermediate Value at the Endpoint Average",
        "zh-CN": "端点平均值处的介值"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "thm-hyp(list-partial(Type.annotation(@g,Type.to(Real,Real)),Type.annotation(list-partial(@x_1,@x_2),Real),Analysis.isContinuousOn(g,Icc(min-binary(x_1,x_2),max-binary(x_1,x_2)))),Logic.exists-typed(@c,Real,Logic.and(Set.mem(c,Icc(min-binary(x_1,x_2),max-binary(x_1,x_2))),Eq(Type.apply(g,c),Div.div(Add.add(Type.apply(g,x_1),Type.apply(g,x_2)),2)))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "A continuous real function assumes the arithmetic mean of its endpoint values at some point between the endpoints.",
          "zh-CN": "连续实函数在两端点之间的某一点取得其端点函数值的算术平均数。"
        }
      }
    },
